17
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:42,921
Paste your rough thoughts, and ask for a short, friendly email with the request in the first two lines.

18
00:00:42,921 --> 00:00:45,268
Setting a word limit is the secret.

19
00:00:45,268 --> 00:00:47,408
It forces the draft to be tight.

20
00:00:48,008 --> 00:00:48,699
Number two.

21
00:00:48,699 --> 00:00:51,050
Pull action items out of long text.

22
00:00:51,050 --> 00:00:58,864
Give it a meeting transcript and ask for decisions, action items with an owner and a deadline, and open questions.

23
00:00:58,864 --> 00:01:03,497
The line that matters is, if something is missing, write not stated.

24
00:01:03,497 --> 00:01:05,779
